# Optional external-CDN fallback for Supertonic 3 KRV MP3 files ({AUDIO_BASE_URL}/{USFM}/{CHAPTER}.mp3).
# Not needed when using the private R2 binding (`AUDIO_BUCKET` in wrangler.json) or local `.cache/krv-supertonic-audio/`.
# AUDIO_BASE_URL=

# Required in production (`wrangler secret put ESV_API_KEY`) and for live local ESV testing (`USE_LIVE_ESV=1 bun run dev`):
# Free non-commercial Crossway ESV API key (https://api.esv.org/)
# Used for live ESV chapter text (/api/esv/:usfm/:chapter) and English audio playback (David Cochran Heath).
# ESV_API_KEY=
